<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka oil refinery may resume work by Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka oil refinery may resume work by Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's sole crude oil refinery, run by the state-owned Ceylon Petroleum Corporation (CPC), may resume refining by Tuesday, a senior official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;We hope to resume refinery operations by Monday or Tuesday,&quot; said the official who declined to be identified. &quot;We have got a new hawser for the (offshore crude oil discharge terminal).&quot;</p>
</text>
